"""Brand marks of external services as inline SVG — no raster assets at all.

The marks are monochrome (fill=currentColor) on purpose. The dashboard ships two
themes, and half of these logos (black Tavily, white Browserbase) would vanish in
one of them if drawn in brand colours. In the limits section colour is also
already meaningful — it encodes how full a quota bar is — so coloured logos would
compete with that signal instead of just labelling the row.

Every path below comes from an official vendor asset or from Simple Icons (CC0);
the source is noted next to each entry. The marks identify the services the agent
talks to — nominative use, no endorsement implied.
"""
